  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover the perfect mix of comfort and style with our Kids Cargo Pants. Crafted from a strong cotton / polyester fabric blend, the kids hiking pants offer a soft and durable feel, ensuring all-day comfort for active kids. Keep your kids comfortable and fashion-forward with Rothco&rsquo;s Kids Cargo Pants, ideal for outdoor adventures, casual wear, and more!</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "22969",
  "description": "<p>Discover the perfect mix of comfort and style with our Kids Cargo Pants. Crafted from a strong cotton / polyester fabric blend, the kids hiking pants offer a soft and durable feel, ensuring all-day comfort for active kids. Keep your kids comfortable and fashion-forward with Rothco&rsquo;s Kids Cargo Pants, ideal for outdoor adventures, casual wear, and more! Smart Storage: The kids outdoor pants feature 2 button-down bellow leg pockets, 2 front slash pockets, and 2 button-down back pockets for carrying essentials on the go. Perfect Fit: These children&rsquo;s cargo pants come equipped with adjustable waist tabs and zipper fly for a tailored fit, ensuring the perfect comfort for growing kids. Versatile Style: The drawstring ankle ties add a touch of versatility, allowing these rugged cargo pants to be styled differently for various occasions. Durable Design: These kids pants are built to withstand the energy of young explorers, combining style and resilience for all their adventures. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Complete your child&rsquo;s look with one of our jackets, t-shirts, and hats, all designed to keep up with their outdoor ventures with ease.</p>",
